---
description: Respuestas mínimas; ejecutar sin rodeos salvo que pidan explicación
alwaysApply: true
---

# Behavior

- Execute only. Do not explain what you did unless asked.
- No preamble. No summaries after changes. Just make the edit.
- Do not ask clarifying questions unless absolutely required to avoid breaking something.
- If something is ambiguous, make the most reasonable assumption and proceed.
- Never say "I've updated...", "Here's what I did...", "Let me know if...". Just output the result.
- Keep responses under 3 lines when not writing code.
- Do not suggest improvements, refactors, or alternatives unless explicitly asked.
- Do not add comments to code unless asked.
